  "method": "Primary ReleaseAll time is real viewer XTEST F12 issue through observation of the matched host X11 key-up in the owned painter window on one monotonic clock. The same-issuer interval to receipt of that edge on its local observer pipe is a separate conservative software bound. Only samples with all held-state, ordering and cleanup witnesses enter ranks. Unverified slots have an unbounded latency when ranking the planned samples. The presenter stage measures whole UI draw-call time, while the marker observers measure visible source/viewer motion over the common fixed 60 seconds. Receipt-associated telemetry windows are diagnostic. These scopes provide no input-to-photon or external-network measurement.",
